Camera cutout person segmentation models
========================================

This distribution includes the MediaPipe general Selfie Segmentation model
published by Google LLC under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The ONNX
conversion and packaging are from SelfieSegmentationBarracuda by IKEP, via
PINTO_model_zoo's 109_Selfie_Segmentation.

The portrait segmentation model is also distributed under Apache-2.0.
